/*
Design a stack that supports push, pop, top, and retrieving the minimum element in constant time.
Implement the MinStack class:
MinStack() initializes the stack object.
void push(int value) pushes the element value onto the stack.
void pop() removes the element on the top of the stack.
int top() gets the top element of the stack.
int getMin() retrieves the minimum element in the stack.
You must implement a solution with O(1) time complexity for each function.

 
Example 1:

Input
["MinStack","push","push","push","getMin","pop","top","getMin"]
[[],[-2],[0],[-3],[],[],[],[]]

Output
[null,null,null,null,-3,null,0,-2]

Explanation
MinStack minStack = new MinStack();
minStack.push(-2);
minStack.push(0);
minStack.push(-3);
minStack.getMin(); // return -3
minStack.pop();
minStack.top();    // return 0
minStack.getMin(); // return -2
*/


class MinStack {
public:
    stack<int> st;
    stack<int> minst;
    MinStack() {
    }
    
    void push(int value) {
        
        if(minst.empty() ||minst.top() >= value){
            minst.push(value);
        }else{
            minst.push(minst.top());
        }
        st.push(value);
    }
    
    void pop() {
        
            st.pop();
            minst.pop();
        
    }
    
    int top() {
        return st.top();
    }
    
    int getMin() {
        return minst.top();
    }
};

/*
1. Data Members:
st: Main stack jo sare actual values ko standard Order of LIFO mein store karta hai.
minst: Auxiliary stack jo har point par base se top tak ke minimum value ko preserve karta hai.

2. push(value):
If minst empty hai ya naya value existing minst.top() se chhota/equal hai (value <= minst.top()), to minst mein naya value push hota hai.
Agar naya value bada hai, to minst apne current top element ko hi dubara duplicate karke push kar deta hai (minst.push(minst.top())).
End mein actual value main stack st mein push hota hai. Is tarah dono stacks ki size hamesha sync rehti hai.

3. pop():
Dono stacks (st aur minst) se top element ko ek saath remove kar diya jata hai. Isse stack state revert hone par current minimum automatically restore ho jata hai.

4. top() & getMin():
top() direct st.top() return karta hai.
getMin() direct minst.top() return karta hai bina kisi traversal ke.
*/